        300.13006591796875,
        117.83917236328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "case of UGA measurements, while the most general instance",
      "bbox": [
        48.960201263427734,
        116.54901123046875,
        300.1036682128906,
        129.83917236328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of an UGA measurement is a mixture of fuzzy membership",
      "bbox": [
        48.960201263427734,
        128.54901123046875,
        300.30224609375,
        141.83917236328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "functions [10, Ch.5]. The aforementioned Bernoulli ﬁlter has",
      "bbox": [
        48.960201263427734,
        140.42913818359375,
        300.03564453125,
        153.71929931640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
