        283.94921875,
        300.1036682128906,
        297.2393798828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "implementation issues. In an attempt to overcome these issues,",
      "bbox": [
        48.95994567871094,
        295.94921875,
        299.9705810546875,
        309.2393798828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "it is of interest to consider an implementation based on box",
