      "text": "the Box-PF was studied and explained through the Bayesian",
      "bbox": [
        48.9599609375,
        403.5895080566406,
        300.06097412109375,
        416.8796691894531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "perspective in [15] by interpreting each box particle as a",
