        48.9595947265625,
        750.14892578125,
        300.1900634765625,
        763.8233032226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the state space X ⊆Rnx. The target, however, may or may not",
      "bbox": [
