        311.9986267089844,
        104.54901123046875,
        563.2496337890625,
        119.2794189453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mahler’s ﬁnite set statistics (FISST) provides practical tools",
