        261.83941650390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The objective of Bayes ﬁltering is to sequentially estimate Xk",
      "bbox": [
        311.9979553222656,
        281.3094482421875,
        562.3509521484375,
        294.9833984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "from measurements collected up to time k. Assume that the",
      "bbox": [
        311.997802734375,
        293.189453125,
        563.0208129882812,
        306.4796142578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "measurement set at time k is denoted by Υk. Then formally",
      "bbox": [
        311.99774169921875,
        305.189453125,
        563.2190551757812,
        318.8634033203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the goal is to estimate sequentially the posterior state pdf",
      "bbox": [
        311.99798583984375,
        317.069580078125,
        563.1160278320312,
        330.3597412109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "fk|k(X|Υ1:k) of a Bernoulli random ﬁnite process, where",
      "bbox": [
        311.99798583984375,
        329.069580078125,
        563.1415405273438,
        343.10369873046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Υ1:k = (Υ1, . . . , Υk) denotes the sequence of measurement",
      "bbox": [
        311.9979248046875,
        341.069580078125,
        563.2874755859375,
        355.4907531738281
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "sets up to time k. The estimation is based on prior knowledge",
      "bbox": [
        311.9975280761719,
        352.94927978515625,
        563.3811645507812,
        366.23944091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of two models, the target dynamic model and the measurement",
      "bbox": [
        311.99755859375,
        364.94927978515625,
        563.1670532226562,
        378.23944091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "model.",
      "bbox": [
        311.9974365234375,
        376.94927978515625,
        338.96820068359375,
        390.23944091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A. Target Dynamic Model",
      "bbox": [
        311.9974365234375,
        411.9256896972656,
        419.1674499511719,
        424.0900573730469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Target dynamic model is deﬁned by the probability density",
      "bbox": [
        321.9576110839844,
        426.1492919921875,
        563.0994873046875,
        439.439453125
